29883d4ec35a31a8393c4ffb220888c44c0bb022:tools/round-49/control-fixtures/pos/PROVINCE.md:430:Round-44 frontier note, 2026-10-28: SquashFS v1/v2 were measured on four standard fixtures (`squashfs_v1`, `squashfs_v2`; counter 4/4), but R44-C1 is not promoted: the frozen claim's output-directory clause disagreed with the counter's `/kaidoku-r44/` provenance binding. SquashFS v1/v2 remain Frontier pending a new pre-data freeze that aligns the predicate and instrument. Still Frontier: `squashfs_v2_nonstandard` (`v2ns-*`; no independent reader), `squashfs_v3_broadcom`, `squashfs_v3_nonstandard`, gzip v3 bodies, v4 Broadcom, LE AVM members (`hsqs`), AVM kernels and nested sub-images below depth 1.
